<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Westpac cuts First Option home loan rate.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Westpac cuts First Option home loan rate.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westpac Banking Corp said on Friday it had further lowered the variable rate for its First Option Home loan to 7.7 percent.</p>
<p>Westpac said the rate was now the lowest variable rate home loan offered either by banks or non-bank lenders.</p>
<p>Westpac said the new First Option rate is effective November 25 for both new and existing customers.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
